--TEST--
A property's `#[Json\Field]` overrides are one attribute, so a second is `E0763`, because `Core\Json\Field` is not `repeatable` — `rule:core-classes/derive-property-list`
--FILE--
<?nvs
#[Core\Json\Derive]
class User {
    #[Core\Json\Field(name: "user_name")]
    #[Core\Json\Field(skip: true)]
    public string $name;

    public function constructor(string $name) {
        $this->name = $name;
    }
}
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0763]: `Core\Json\Field` is used twice here, and its declaration is not `repeatable`
  --> case.nvs:4:7
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
